  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\n\"Nestled in the heart of Cabo San Lucas, Mexico, Santa Tinta CSL is a cutting-edge tattoo studio specializing in minimalist, illustrative, and floral designs. Their comprehensive array of services spans from expert tattooing and certified titanium jewelry to professional piercings and tattoo removal, provided by their diverse team of skilled artists. The ambiance of creativity and passion for the art permeates the studio, making it a uniquely welcoming sanctuary for body art enthusiasts.\"\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Cabo San Lucas, Baja California Sur, Mexico"
